Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire\NKnight of the Ribbon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Knight of the Ribbon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Forty-Third Episode\NThe Spider Island\NSapphire Caught in a Trap
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.36,0:02:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.89,0:02:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hop, hop! Hup, hup!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.73,0:02:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.87,0:02:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.92,0:02:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,A ship! It's so pretty! Wonderful! Cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.42,0:02:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right! I'll go tell Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.18,0:02:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, wake up, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.01,0:02:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a lovely swan ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.14,0:02:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,A swan ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.80,0:03:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow! What an amazing ship! Whose could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.64,0:03:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, let's hurry and check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.14,0:03:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I kind of want to step aboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.62,0:03:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, please, step right on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.88,0:03:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Duke Duralumin had this ship custom-built specially for Lord Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.95,0:03:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, right this way, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.91,0:03:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Grand Duke Duralumin? That seems a bit suspicious.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.36,0:03:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Still, it is tempting...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.94,0:03:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, right this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.03,0:03:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, let me step aboard just for a moment and take a look inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.63,0:03:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,My dearest, I've prepared a wonderful present for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.84,0:04:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Candy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.84,0:04:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing so simple. Tomorrow, all of Silverland will be yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.92,0:04:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That beautiful swan ship was rigged from the very start.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.74,0:04:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The ship's destination is... the Rose...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.72,0:04:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.46,0:04:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.07,0:04:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything is going smoothly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.71,0:04:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.30,0:04:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,The ship has been rigged. Now we just sit back and watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.86,0:04:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything on the island is set, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.49,0:04:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,On that deserted island, Sapphire will disappear without anyone knowing,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.08,0:04:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,and the rest will go according to your plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.10,0:04:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well. Do it right..
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.31,0:04:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What a beautiful swan ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.26,0:04:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.07,0:04:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.94,0:04:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Traveling on a ship like this would be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.01,0:04:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Going on and on forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.51,0:05:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,This ship, it's moving on its own!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.70,0:05:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.85,0:05:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Somebody!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.21,0:05:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.56,0:05:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.12,0:05:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.68,0:05:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Marlin!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.34,0:05:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.94,0:05:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.33,0:05:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.96,0:05:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.02,0:06:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess it was no use...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.27,0:06:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This rudder isn't working at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.41,0:06:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been swept all the way out to sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.19,0:06:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz is all the way over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.40,0:06:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.03,0:06:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Here goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.80,0:06:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.23,0:07:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Glad I made it in time. I was just out for a morning walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.82,0:07:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.11,0:07:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, why don't you come inside here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.06,0:07:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm? I'm fine right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.70,0:08:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, amazing. This island is full of roses.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.77,0:08:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.02,0:08:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,With all these flowers blooming, there isn't even a hint of that lovely scent.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.24,0:08:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a strange island, but let's walk around a bit anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.02,0:08:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,A rose tunnel!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.29,0:08:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.69,0:08:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did Tink go?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.73,0:08:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.95,0:08:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink! Tink! Tink! Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.54,0:09:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,R-Roses...!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.73,0:09:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire! Look out! Something's wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.98,0:09:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.26,0:09:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What are these guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.58,0:09:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, hide behind me! Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.13,0:09:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a man! Leave this to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.59,0:09:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I come, monster cats!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.56,0:09:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz! The cats!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.48,0:10:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.69,0:10:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.40,0:10:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.04,0:10:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.50,0:11:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.74,0:11:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Over here, monster cats!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.28,0:11:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You're facing the Ribbon Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.51,0:11:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.77,0:11:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Where on earth could he have gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.65,0:11:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.04,0:12:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.16,0:12:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.44,0:12:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.00,0:12:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.60,0:12:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.49,0:12:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.27,0:12:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.67,0:12:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, come on, pull yourself together.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.78,0:12:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.28,0:12:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like Prince Franz was caught by the cats, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.21,0:12:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it, this island is no ordinary place.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.99,0:12:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, it's my fault. I'll go search for Prince Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.83,0:12:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But searching a terrifying island like this...?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.35,0:12:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.07,0:12:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,How strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.86,0:12:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,This cobweb is as thick as a rope.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.08,0:12:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,There must be something going on. Let's follow this thread.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.85,0:13:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're awake, Franz.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.18,0:13:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?! Why did you capture me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.22,0:13:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.68,0:13:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the guardian of this island, Spider Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.39,0:13:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,My master ordered me to take Princess Sapphire from the swan ship
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.94,0:13:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,and wipe her out in total secrecy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.58,0:13:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I never expected to get a bonus like you along with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.58,0:13:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll send you to heaven first!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.73,0:13:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So everything was a trap from the start?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.94,0:13:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.97,0:13:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, prepare to share the same fate as pretty Princess Sapphire. Farewell!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.92,0:14:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.98,0:14:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.23,0:14:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I came to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.22,0:14:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use—this isn't ordinary thread. Wait, Tink, go find some water.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.37,0:14:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.45,0:14:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't think... Sapphire escaped safely! Rest assured!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.73,0:14:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.03,0:14:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But Ribbon Knight, just who are you to Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.42,0:14:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This is no time for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.99,0:14:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to get out of here while the Spider Man is asleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.49,0:15:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just water, what do we do with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.39,0:15:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, splash it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.59,0:15:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, let's run!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.33,0:15:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,They ran off!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.22,0:15:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm exhausted!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.05,0:15:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink! Hurry, or they'll find us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.56,0:15:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on ahead! I can't go any further!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.67,0:15:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.47,0:15:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,A mere scratch from this sword is fatal. Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.40,0:16:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That goes for you over there, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.19,0:16:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz! Hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.24,0:16:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.23,0:16:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to get out of this forest fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.24,0:16:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.17,0:16:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Just you wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.15,0:17:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.99,0:17:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,they say a cure grows wherever a venomous monster makes its nest.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.50,0:17:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Look around here and find that herb for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.42,0:17:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood. Right away...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.31,0:17:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.79,0:17:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.99,0:17:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.51,0:17:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.94,0:17:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.41,0:17:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's having a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.75,0:17:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Poor thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.84,0:18:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.96,0:18:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.81,0:18:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm right here. Rest easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.40,0:18:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.45,0:18:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I found it, I found it! Apply this, and the Spider Man's venom will...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.06,0:18:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Now you're dressed as Sapphire...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.82,0:18:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, the herbs!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.38,0:18:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.08,0:18:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Will he be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.30,0:18:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll be fine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.09,0:18:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Silence! I'll tolerate no excuses!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.64,0:19:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,True, I didn't tell you to kill Franz as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.62,0:19:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're an assassin! How could you lose to a kid like that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.07,0:19:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't lost yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.97,0:19:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The moment he stabbed me, I wounded him with my dagger.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.66,0:19:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,By now, the poison has spread through his body. He can't possibly be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.25,0:19:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I came here to claim Princess Sapphire's body.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.04,0:19:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,A promise is a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.96,0:19:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the Spider Man such a coward to stay in bed over a mere scratch?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.44,0:19:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, use your prized thread to get rid of Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.34,0:19:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If they're injured too, they couldn't have escaped the island yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.58,0:19:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.82,0:19:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.49,0:19:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.39,0:19:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. She nursed me all night long.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.95,0:20:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink already put Sapphire on the swan ship and sent her back to the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.85,0:20:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.62,0:20:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You must've been having a fever dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.33,0:20:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we need to go fix the boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.91,0:20:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You get some rest for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.55,0:20:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That should take care of the chores, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.94,0:20:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm all better now, too. We can finally go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.36,0:20:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so fast! Princess Sapphire, I'll be taking your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.13,0:20:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Spider Man?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.03,0:20:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wearing a ridiculous disguise, but you're Princess Sapphire, aren't you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.65,0:20:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the Knight of the Ribbon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.86,0:20:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't matter. You won't leave this island alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.16,0:20:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Get the little one!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.91,0:20:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.88,0:21:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That face doesn't scare me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.42,0:21:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I brought some catnip.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.74,0:21:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the end!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.98,0:22:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.16,0:22:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.19,0:22:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,They all ate the catnip and calmed right down.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.80,0:22:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Damn, foiled again!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.15,0:22:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Ribbon Knight, Tink, and Franz... They're formidable foes.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.78,0:22:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But I am Duralumin! I won't back down like this. Next time, for sure!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.14,0:22:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sapphire, even if they say it was just a fever dream,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.92,0:22:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1} I will never forget the happiness of that moment when you nursed me back to health.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.79,0:22:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Franz,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.10,0:22:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}thank you.{\i0}
